{"at": "2026-11-06T04:00:29.769783+00:00", "args": ["inspect", "docs/benchmarks/runs/2026-11-10-p4c/animl/volume.animl"], "exit": 0, "stdout": "volume (grid 40, viewBox 0 0 40 12)\n\nglyphs (bbox: minX minY maxX maxY, grid units; hole hints use bbox containment only)\n\nnodes\n  speaker (group) pivot 5,6 animates scale\n    body (rect)\n    cone (path)\n    mute-line (path) animates opacity\n  waves (group) animates opacity\n    wave1 (arc) animates opacity\n    wave2 (arc) animates opacity\n    wave3 (arc) animates opacity\n  track (path)\n  fill (path) animates stroke.trimEnd\n  slider-space (group)\n    knob (circle) animates x\n\ninputs: volume (number), muted (bool)\n\ntimelines\n  silent: 0.2s once, reduced motion: end\n    writes wave1.opacity, wave2.opacity, wave3.opacity\n  one: 0.2s once, reduced motion: end\n    writes wave1.opacity, wave2.opacity, wave3.opacity\n  two: 0.2s once, reduced motion: end\n    writes wave1.opacity, wave2.opacity, wave3.opacity\n  three: 0.2s once, reduced motion: end\n    writes wave1.opacity, wave2.opacity, wave3.opacity\n  pulse: 0.2s once, reduced motion: end\n    writes speaker.scale\n\nmachine\n  layer sound (writes wave1.opacity, wave2.opacity, wave3.opacity)\n    *blend: play silent (no way out)\n  layer feedback (writes speaker.scale)\n     watch: pose {}\n        volume >= 0 \u2192 pop\n    *idle: pose {\"speaker.scale\":1} (no way out)\n     pop: play pulse\n        @end \u2192 idle\n\nbound\n  knob.x\n  fill.stroke.trimEnd\n  waves.opacity\n  mute-line.opacity\n\nlisteners\n  click on speaker \u2192 toggle muted\n  drag on knob \u2192 \n", "stderr": ""}
